{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "0CIS", "placeholders": {"ACCENT_0001": "\\'e"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-etale-unramified}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:6f8d1103736b02990953d025866de604751dfdd0c4a96ecccd15d08230f22a5e", "source_text": "An <ACCENT_0001>tale morphism is unramified.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:d57d736c01df2fb6141ac97c7ca99097e09bb80c2ee413fababb19bf7059acc9", "unit_id": "tag:0CIW:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "0CIS", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{remark-etale-smooth-implication}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{spaces-morphisms-lemma-etale-unramified}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:cf22aef8ecd67c562f9e3766a2ba7bae10fac95e0a9e71b3929679da77f83f00", "source_text": "Follows from Remark <REF_0001>\nand Morphisms of Spaces, Lemma\n<REF_0002>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:c5ecc09dcfa9f315e80af758116e435d97f338ede3a68c5f55c760f8a2c4615a", "unit_id": "tag:0CIW:proof"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "0CIS", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-immersion-unramified}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:927c0275a2418e41ee22e76f26182c80911b23c4caaf67b7fcc62dc39df33aa3", "source_text": "An immersion is unramified.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:bd086e63d472c5edeaf0c5e5013f4db672b59de7f1d2f3e403bade37e05ec495", "unit_id": "tag:0CIX:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "0CIS", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$j : \\mathcal{Z} \\to \\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0002": "$j$", "MATH_0003": "$X \\to \\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0004": "$X$", "MATH_0005": "$Z = \\mathcal{Z} \\times_\\mathcal{X} X$", "MATH_0006": "$X$", "MATH_0007": "$Z \\to X$", "MATH_0008": "$j$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-trivial-implications}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{morphisms-lemma-open-immersion-unramified}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{morphisms-lemma-closed-immersion-unramified}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:37add4dd95b28012e76a4caa76d6ca1947006058ec6b813a3048cb4077f9de9a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:811c4d1642fac9cf7ef38b2596341ff3f91fbbbf31d31a6ea4eff48c8c15da14", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be an immersion of\nalgebraic stacks. Since <MATH_0002> is representable, it is DM by\nLemma <REF_0001>. On the other hand,\nif <MATH_0003> is a smooth and surjective morphism\nwhere <MATH_0004> is a scheme, then <MATH_0005>\nis a locally closed subscheme of <MATH_0006>. Hence <MATH_0007> is unramified\n(Morphisms, Lemmas <REF_0002> and\n<REF_0003>)\nand we conclude that <MATH_0008> is unramified from the definition.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:874c52e1a8a42e0acaf6881d73a138c237302615d9defca4cd398fc08a8afe0d", "unit_id": "tag:0CIX:proof"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "0CIS", "placeholders": {"ACCENT_0001": "\\'e", "ACCENT_0002": "\\'e", "MATH_0001": "$f : \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0002": "$f$", "MATH_0003": "$f$", "MATH_0004": "$V \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0005": "$V$", "MATH_0006": "$U \\to V \\times_\\mathcal{Y} \\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0007": "$U$", "MATH_0008": "$U \\to V$", "MATH_0009": "$W \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0010": "$W$", "MATH_0011": "$T \\to W \\times_\\mathcal{Y} \\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0012": "$T$", "MATH_0013": "$T \\to W$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\item", "STRUCT_0005": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-unramified}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:0b025c50a6afc1514272533e486dcfb6455af1584cbde6384c090eef04bebb00", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:0ee3b270ee995a7e2f80a02fdc0137ece920bffe8185475cd1349224255db86d", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of algebraic stacks.\nThe following are equivalent\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0002> is unramified,\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0003> is DM and for any morphism <MATH_0004>\nwhere <MATH_0005> is an algebraic space and any <ACCENT_0001>tale morphism\n<MATH_0006> where <MATH_0007> is an algebraic space,\nthe morphism <MATH_0008> is unramified,\n<STRUCT_0004> there exists some surjective, locally of finite presentation, and flat\nmorphism <MATH_0009> where <MATH_0010> is an algebraic space and some\nsurjective <ACCENT_0002>tale morphism <MATH_0011>\nwhere <MATH_0012> is an algebraic space such that the morphism <MATH_0013> is unramified.\n<STRUCT_0005>\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:2a8dcbea284192f9faef4a9c88d5b24e5d85856174a0708c32269efce087a896", "unit_id": "tag:0CIY:statement"}
